OL,3,GNEWSA'It's not a playground' - mountain
OL,4,Arescue team reaches record number of   
OL,5,Acall-outs                              
OL,7,FA mountain rescuer has said mountain   
OL,8,Franges are not a "public playground"   
OL,9,Fafter his team reached its highest     
OL,10,Fnumber of call-outs on record.         
OL,12,FOgwen Valley Mountain Rescue, based in 
OL,13,FEryri National Park, recently attended 
OL,14,Fits 200th rescue this year - a report  
OL,15,Fof a fallen walker on Tryfan mountain. 
OL,17,FChris Lloyd, 71, said the increasing   
OL,18,Fnumbers of people visiting the mountain
OL,19,Fand the growing numbers needing help   
OL,20,Fwas "putting a lot of pressure on      
OL,21,Fvolunteers".                           
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
