OL,3,GNEWSA'It's not a playground' - mountain
OL,4,Arescue team reaches record number of   
OL,5,Acall-outs                              
OL,7,FIn 2025, the team completed 186        
OL,8,Frescues, in what was previously their  
OL,9,Fbusiest year on record - they expect to
OL,10,Fhit about 230 calls by the end of the  
OL,11,Fyear.                                  
